<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I was sorry to hear about the damage to your <em><strong>&lt;item&gt;</strong></em> in your carry-on baggage while travelling with us on <em><strong>&lt;Flight Number&gt;</strong></em>.<br />
<br />
<strong>Personal items under your care and control</strong><br />
We try to make sure your journey with us is safe and do our best to help all passengers look after their belongings onboard and through our airports.<br />
<br />
Under our <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/book-a-trip/flights/conditions-of-carriage.html">Conditions of Carriage</a>, you’re responsible for your personal items that are in your care and control. This means any loss of/damage to carry-on items isn’t eligible for compensation claims.<br />
<br />
<strong>We’re here to help</strong><br />
Although we’re unable to cover any loss/damage, your travel insurance policy may cover these sorts of situations.<br />
<br />
Please let us know if you’d like me to provide you with an insurance letter to assist with any claims – we're here to help.</body>
